# practice-bank / mock explanation-authoring scratch: per-batch dumps,
# manifests, and one-off generate/explain/validate/verify scripts written
# during a single authoring session. The lasting outputs are the DB itself
# (via load_explanations) and the *_practice.py content files + their
# scripts/convert_*_to_json.py / export_*_explanations_by_content.py
# tooling, which stay tracked as normal.
mdcat-content/*_db_dump.json
mdcat-content/mock*_explanations/
scripts/*_db_dump.json
scripts/*_image_manifest.json
scripts/*explanations*.json
scripts/*_expl_batch*.json
scripts/gen_phy_batch*.py
scripts/explain_mock*_*.py
scripts/generate_mock*_explanations.py
scripts/generate_*_practice_explanations.py
scripts/validate_batch.py
scripts/verify_*_practice.py
